User-global subagent definitions for the polytoken layer live here and are
discovered via `daemon.discovery.extra_subagents_dirs` in config.template.yaml.

Definitions are `<name>.md` files with frontmatter — see the shipped examples
via `polytoken vfs ls polytoken://subagents` and `polytoken vfs cat
polytoken://subagents/researcher.md`, and validate drafts with
`polytoken validate --type subagent <file>`.

None ship yet. IMPORTANT: every `.md` file in this directory is parsed as a
subagent definition (a README here breaks the registry load — that is why
this note lives in .gitkeep and not README.md). This file is a directory
placeholder only.
